{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Brill has a trainer for every CoA class (#6552)",
  "contract": [
    "Brill, the first Horde town of Tirisfal Glades, offered only the stock class trainers, so a CoA character who left Deathknell had nowhere nearby to train.",
    "With the CoA class trainer event 195 running, each of the 21 CoA classes 12-32 has exactly one trainer of its class within 60 yards of the centre of the Brill town square, in the world phase.",
    "The trainer posts are inferred, not sourced, so each one is also checked against the terrain: the ground height under every post lies within 0.75 yd of its spawn height."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 240000,
